<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">Your session next week 🌱</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, here is everything you need for <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> under the <strong>{{programName}}</strong> programme.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Date</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{eventDate}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Time</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{eventTime}} ({{durationHours}}h)</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Venue</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{location}}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:4px 16px 4px 0;color:#5E6E7E;">Coordinator</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-weight:700;">{{coordinatorName}} · {{coordinatorMobile}}</td></tr>
</table>
{{#if activityDescription}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>About this session:</strong> {{activityDescription}}</p>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">All session materials (story, lesson plan, worksheets) will be prepared and provided by your Field Coordinator on the day — just bring yourself and your enthusiasm.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#5E6E7E;font-size:13px;">Plans changed? Please withdraw from the session in the volunteer portal so someone on the waitlist can take your place.</p>
